<title>UK: Powell Duffryn restores profit at H1.</title>
<headline>Powell Duffryn restores profit at H1.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		13.8		   vs 12.9</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 8.0		    vs 8.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     6.6 profit	   vs 13.0 loss</p>
<p> Turnover		   414.0		  vs 435.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Ports and engineering group Powell Duffryn Plc said its earnings per share calculation was before exceptional items.  </p>
<p> Operating result	 22.2		   vs 10.4</p>
<p> Exceptional charge     11.5		   vs 19.5</p>
<p> Interest paid	    4.1		    vs 3.9</p>
<p> Tax			  7.7		    vs 2.8</p>
<p> Net taxed loss	   1.1		    vs 15.8</p>
<p> Retained loss	    8.5		    vs 22.9</p>
<p> Pay date		   January 7, 1997</p>
<p> Div registration date  December 10</p>
<p> Ex-div date		December 2</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
